==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{af|ru|хвати́ть|-ся}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|хвати́ться}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|хвати́ться|pf|impf=хвата́ться}}

# to [[snatch]] ''(at)'', to [[grip]], to [[pluck]] ''(at)'', to [[catch]] ''(at)''
# {{lb|ru|colloquial}} to [[miss]], to [[notice]] [[the]] [[absence]] ''(of)'', to [[find]] [[that]] [[someone]]/[[something]] [[is]] [[missing]]
#: {{ux|ru|'''хвати́ться''' [[кто|кого́]]-[[л]]|t=to miss someone; notice someone's absence}}
#: {{ux|ru|его́ '''хвати́лись''', [[но]] [[быть|бы́ло]] [[по́здно]]|t=when they missed him, it was too late}}
#: {{ux|ru|[[когда́]] [[вы]] '''хвати́лись''' [[бумажник|бума́жника]]?|t=when did you first miss your wallet?}}
# {{lb|ru|colloquial}} to [[remember]]
#: {{ux|ru|[[я]] [[сли́шком]] [[по́здно]] '''хвати́лся'''|I remembered [thought of] it too late}}
# {{infl of|ru|хвати́ть||pass}}

